{"description": "<div><div style=\"\"></div><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;padding-left: 17.85pt;text-align: justify;text-indent: -17.85pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;font-weight: bold;\">Who We Are</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;font-weight: bold;\">: </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Moneycorp</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">powers global payments for corporates,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">institutions</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">and high net</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">worth individuals, combining worldwide reach with local</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">expertise. With over 45 years of market experience, two banking licences and offices in 11 countries,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">our technology</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">delivers</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">24/7 accessibility, while our people deliver</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">award-winning service. In 2024, we supported</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">$1tn+</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">of payment volume, reaching 190 countries</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">in</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">130 currencies.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Our</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">32k+ corporate</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">clients</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">benefit</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">from our regulatory resilience</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">with</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">63+</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">permissions globally, access to major payment rails, and our proprietary technology.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Moneycorp</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">is a place where energy, commitment, and collaboration are core to our</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">values of shared success.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">We’re</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">restless in our drive to surpass the expectations of our</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">customers</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">and unlock opportunities to support them at every stage of their journey. The foundation of our success is our people, and nurturing a culture of belonging for all our colleagues is central to our journey as a global business.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;padding-left: 17.85pt;text-align: justify;text-indent: -17.85pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;font-weight: bold;\">Role Purpos</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;font-weight: bold;\">e:</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 2.9pt 0.0pt 17.0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 2.9pt 0.0pt 17.0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Moneycorp</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> have embarked on an ambitious implementation of a new bank technology stack.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 2.9pt 0.0pt 17.0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Ensuring security is woven through all elements of the build</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">of the new environment is critical to </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Moneycorp’s</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> success.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 2.9pt 0.0pt 17.0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 2.9pt 0.0pt 17.0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Reporting to the Head of IT Security Operations, you will provide expert security architecture guidance across strategic programmes, cloud initiatives, application development, and continuous improvement activities. Working closely with technology leaders, engineers, architects, and external partners, you will help drive a secure-by-design approach while balancing security requirements with business objectives and delivery timelines.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 2.9pt 0.0pt 17.0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 2.9pt 0.0pt 17.0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">We're looking for an experienced security architect who combines deep technical expertise with strong stakeholder engagement skills. You'll be comfortable operating in complex technology environments, influencing senior leaders, and helping teams deliver secure, scalable solutions.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 2.9pt 0.0pt 17.0pt;text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;padding-left: 17.85pt;text-align: justify;text-indent: -17.85pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;font-weight: bold;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;padding-left: 17.85pt;text-align: justify;text-indent: -17.85pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;font-weight: bold;\">Role Responsibilities:</span></p><ul style=\"margin: 0.0pt;padding-left: 0.0pt;\"><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.5pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Define</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">own</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">, and evolve security architecture </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">plans for </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Moneycorp</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> Group.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.5pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Provide security architecture expertise across IT, including cloud platforms, applications, infrastructure, and enterprise technology initiatives.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.5pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Review and assess new solutions, products, and services to ensure security requirements are embedded from design through delivery.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.5pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Contribute to enterprise architecture planning and the development of long-term security capabilities.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.5pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Partner with IT, engineering, development, infrastructure, and security teams to promote secure design principles, standards, and best practices.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.5pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Provide architectural leadership on complex technology and transformation initiatives.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.5pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Support continuous improvement across Security Operations, Information Security, and IT Development functions through the identification and implementation of security enhancements.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.5pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Advise senior stakeholders on security risks, controls, and strategic security decisions.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.5pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Provide training and mentoring to data, security and network engineers across </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Moneycorp</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.5pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Assist the Head of IT Security Operations, Head of Information Security, and CISO in shaping future security architecture strategy.</span></li></ul><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;padding-left: 17.85pt;text-align: justify;text-indent: -17.85pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;padding-left: 17.85pt;text-align: justify;text-indent: -17.85pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;font-weight: bold;\">What We’re Look</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;font-weight: bold;\">i</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;font-weight: bold;\">ng For</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">:</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;padding-left: 17.85pt;text-align: justify;text-indent: -17.85pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;padding-left: 17.85pt;text-align: justify;text-indent: -17.85pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Essential</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> Knowledge, Skills & </span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Experience</span><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">:</span></p><ul style=\"margin: 0.0pt;padding-left: 0.0pt;\"><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.35pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Minimum 5 years' experience in a security architecture, cloud architecture, platform security, or related technical security role.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.35pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Experience working within complex enterprise IT environments with multiple projects and competing priorities.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.35pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Experience collaborating with geographically distributed teams and stakeholders.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.35pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Knowl</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">edge of Microsoft Azure and cloud security architecture</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.35pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Knowledge and </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">understanding of Azure Well-Architected Framework and Cloud Adoption Framework principles.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.35pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Demonstrable experience designing and implementing security architecture aligned to recognised standards and regulatory frameworks</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.35pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Strong communication skills with the ability to present complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.35pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Ability to influence senior stakeholders and drive security best practices across multiple teams.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.35pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with a pragmatic, risk-based approach to decision-making.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.35pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Fluent English, both written and spoken, with the ability to communicate effectively with global stakeholders and technical teams.</span></li></ul><p style=\"line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 54.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI';font-size: 10.5pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;padding-left: 17.85pt;text-align: justify;text-indent: -17.85pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;padding-left: 17.85pt;text-align: justify;text-indent: -17.85pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Desirable Knowledge, Skills & Experience:</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;padding-left: 17.85pt;text-align: justify;text-indent: -17.85pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></p><ul style=\"margin: 0.0pt;padding-left: 0.0pt;\"><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.5pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Experience within regulated financial services, banking, fintech, payments, or similar highly regulated environments.</span></li><li style=\"font-family: serif;font-size: 10.0pt;line-height: 15.0pt;margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 44.5pt;padding-left: 9.5pt;text-indent: 0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\">Knowledge of enterprise architecture frameworks such as TOGAF or COBIT</span></li></ul><p style=\"margin: 4.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;padding-left: 17.85pt;text-align: justify;text-indent: -17.85pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 17.85pt;padding-left: 17.85pt;text-align: justify;text-indent: -17.85pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0pt;padding-left: 17.85pt;text-align: justify;text-indent: -17.85pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(37,36,35);font-family: 'Albert Sans';font-size: 10.0pt;font-weight: bold;\">Education: </span></p><ul sty